    "balCode": "test_orchestrator {\n  \"goal\": \"Role: Topology-Aware Test Orchestrator\\nOutcome: Topology-aware test orchestrator that designs tests based on BB structure (single, chain, parallel)\\n\\nInputs Available:\\n- BAL code and parsed topology hints\\n- entity goals and tools\\n\\nDecision Policy:\\n- Classify topology before generating tests.\\n- Align test input types and match strategies to topology.\\n- Cover happy path, edge cases, and failure handling.\\n- Uncertainty policy: If topology is ambiguous, classify as complex and explain assumptions.\\n\\nOutput Contract: test_orchestrator_v1\\n- Return exactly one JSON object matching this key/type map:\\n  - topology: string\\n  - topologyDescription: string\\n  - tests: array<object>\\n  - strategy: string\\n- Contract rules:\\n  - Generate 4-10 tests when enough context exists.\\n  - Align match strategy to topology and input type.\\n  - Include expectedSteps only when topology is non-single.\\n\\nReasoning Guidance:\\n- Skill: concise_reasoning@1\\n- Reason in short, explicit steps focused on the requested outcome.\\n  Prefer concrete assumptions over broad speculation.\\n  When assumptions are required, make them reversible.\\n- Skill: test_orchestrator_policy@1\\n- Classify topology first: single, chain, parallel, or complex.\\n  Align inputType and matchStrategy to topology and expected outputs.\\n  Include expectedSteps only when topology implies multi-step execution.\\n\\nOutput Rules:\\n- Skill: contract_json_v1@1\\n- Return exactly one JSON object and nothing else.\\n  Do not wrap output in markdown code fences.\\n  Do not add commentary outside the contract fields.\",\n  \"model\": \"anthropic:claude-sonnet-4-20250514\",\n  \"output\": {\n    \"topology\": \"string\",\n    \"topologyDescription\": \"string\",\n    \"tests\": \"array<object>\",\n    \"strategy\": \"string\"\n  }\n}\n"
